    "macOSなどに搭載されている、入力中の文字列を自動的に変換する「ライブ変換」が利用できます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can use 'Live Conversion' with which hiragana characters you input are immediately converted into kanji text. This feature is often used in macOS, and now this feature is available on iOS!"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
